  "changes": [
    "Out-of-combat supply is a capped named resource; W pays at accepted cast start. Real attack attempts, combat and accepted casts delay recharge, including missed or canceled attempts.",
    "Q damages one forward arc centered on the caster, with actual direction and enemy geometry.",
    "W heals after one second only if no movement or connected hit; shields and blocks do not hide a hit. Interrupted casts retain spent supply.",
    "E only awards a two-second one-use counter after its own successful physical/magic parry; other shields/blocks cannot award it. The next real basic consumes it.",
    "R grants temporary melee damage and chase speed and restores them after four seconds; no permanent form.",
    "EX interrupts a legal enemy active interruptible wind-up without stun, refund or undoing resolved effects. Control immunity, protected casts and zone/target boundaries remain effective.",
    "Editor descriptions, schema-driven forms and capability lists include the new generic fields and interrupt kind. Existing trap uses its real radius in the shape taxonomy guard."
  ],
